{"race_id":"2026-14","insights":[{"topic":"Tyre issues","detail":"The Hard compound tyre was incredibly resilient with low degradation, which dictated strategy.","sources":[{"provider":"www.mercedesamgf1.com","url":"https://www.mercedesamgf1.com/reports/race-report-victory-in-spain-as-madring-makes-f1-debut","published_at":null}]},{"topic":"Strategy issues","detail":"Kimi Antonelli started on the Medium compound and George Russell started on the Hard compound.","sources":[{"provider":"www.mercedesamgf1.com","url":"https://www.mercedesamgf1.com/reports/race-report-victory-in-spain-as-madring-makes-f1-debut","published_at":null}]},{"topic":"Next-race expectations","detail":"The team has one week to get ready for Baku and the beginning of the first of three triple-headers.","sources":[{"provider":"www.mercedesamgf1.com","url":"https://www.mercedesamgf1.com/reports/race-report-victory-in-spain-as-madring-makes-f1-debut","published_at":null}]},{"topic":"Race assessment","detail":"Kimi Antonelli won the Spanish Grand Prix with George Russell finishing fifth.","sources":[{"provider":"www.mercedesamgf1.com","url":"https://www.mercedesamgf1.com/reports/race-report-victory-in-spain-as-madring-makes-f1-debut","published_at":null}]},{"topic":"Incidents","detail":"A Virtual Safety Car was deployed on lap 14.","sources":[{"provider":"www.mercedesamgf1.com","url":"https://www.mercedesamgf1.com/reports/race-report-victory-in-spain-as-madring-makes-f1-debut","published_at":null}]},{"topic":"Key quotes","detail":"Kimi Antonelli: \"It was great to get the victory today, but we know we were a little bit fortunate with the timing of the Virtual Safety Car.\"","sources":[{"provider":"www.mercedesamgf1.com","url":"https://www.mercedesamgf1.com/reports/race-report-victory-in-spain-as-madring-makes-f1-debut","published_at":null}]}],"sources":[{"provider":"www.mercedesamgf1.com","url":"https://www.mercedesamgf1.com/reports/race-report-victory-in-spain-as-madring-makes-f1-debut","published_at